+	 *
+	 * Select opens PicoDrive's menu rather than acting as MODE. A real Mega
+	 * Drive pad has no Select at all, MODE is needed by almost nothing, and
+	 * without a menu button the stick has no way to reach the controls or
+	 * leave the emulator. */
+	/* Six-button Mega Drive pad across the two rows: X Y Z along the top,
+	 * A B C along the bottom, matching how the hardware pad is laid out.
+	 *
+	 * The directions are NOT here. The stick has twelve buttons and SDL
